    {
      "id": "IlvDSKyQ4zbVdEcVR7ssg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 497.150934474417,
      "y": 1017.1096542352019,
      "width": 639.8995361328125,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1452593345,
      "version": 435,
      "versionNonce": 549338753,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1765391898269,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Example : \nWhen a payment is successful , Stripe sends a message to our \nwebhook endpoint\n\nPOST /webhook\n\nMessage contains :\n\n- payment status\n- amount\n- user\n- orderId ...\n\nWhy we need Webhook ?\n\n- Redirecting to the success page DOES NOT guarantee payment\n\n====> If we rely only on the frontend : \n- Risk making orders as paid when they NOT paid\n- Risk missing payments when the redirect fails",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Example : \nWhen a payment is successful , Stripe sends a message to our \nwebhook endpoint\n\nPOST /webhook\n\nMessage contains :\n\n- payment status\n- amount\n- user\n- orderId ...\n\nWhy we need Webhook ?\n\n- Redirecting to the success page DOES NOT guarantee payment\n\n====> If we rely only on the frontend : \n- Risk making orders as paid when they NOT paid\n- Risk missing payments when the redirect fails",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GidZuaYuJOLfP677_942g",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 498.150934474417,
      "y": 1555.109654235202,
      "width": 564.7596435546875,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1433841231,
      "version": 367,
      "versionNonce": 1268072417,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1765392590181,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " When a payment succeeds , Stripe redirects to the user :\n\n/payment-success\n\nUser can : \n\n. close the tab\n. lose internet\n. browser crashes ...\n\n==> We will never get the success status\n==> The order will stay unpaid\n==> Money is actually taken\n\n====> We cannot confirm Payment with only Frontend !",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " When a payment succeeds , Stripe redirects to the user :\n\n/payment-success\n\nUser can : \n\n. close the tab\n. lose internet\n. browser crashes ...\n\n==> We will never get the success status\n==> The order will stay unpaid\n==> Money is actually taken\n\n====> We cannot confirm Payment with only Frontend !",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "pe5Ex4jseIuf3BuODTiPu",
